60:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","em",null,{"className":"text-[0.95em] text-muted not-italic","children":["免责与披露:本文是一篇避雷页。事实基础是 2026-09-05 当天登录 Fastlink 后台的实测(面板、五档商店价、公告、客户端页)与跑路监测库 limbo ",["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"#200"}]," 帖的公开跟帖原文;我们",["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"没有"}],"断定 Fastlink 已经跑路——它未被任何主流跑路名单坐实,官网与支付至今正常。我们断定的是:",["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"它在收钱,但它的服务在 8—9 月持续被报告不可用。"}]]}]}]
